			<item>
				<title>Alla scoperta di Budapest</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/it/sightseeing/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/it/sightseeing/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Se siete in città per il nostro matrimonio in crociera, vi consigliamo di visitare questi luoghi iconici:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;attraction-grid&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/parliament.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Il Parlamento ungherese riflesso nel Danubio&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;Il Parlamento ungherese&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Un capolavoro architettonico visibile direttamente dal Danubio.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p class=&#34;photo-credit&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hungarian_Parliament_Building_2023-9.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Photo: Pierre Blaché&#xA;                (CC0)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/fishermans-bastion-pinterest.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Il Bastione dei Pescatori con vista sul Danubio e su Budapest&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;Il Castello di Buda e il Bastione dei Pescatori&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Salite sulla collina per ammirare una splendida vista panoramica sulla città.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p class=&#34;photo-credit&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://ph.pinterest.com/pin/641059328208145770/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Photo: Pinterest pin&#xA;                (Source)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/szechenyi-baths.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Le piscine all&amp;#39;aperto delle Terme Széchenyi&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;Le Terme Széchenyi&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Il luogo ideale per rilassarvi prima dei festeggiamenti.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p class=&#34;photo-credit&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sz%C3%A9chenyi_thermal_bath,_Budapest.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Photo: Slyronit&#xA;                (CC BY-SA 4.0)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/veli-bej-historic.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Veduta storica del complesso termale Császár, legato a Veli Bej&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;Terme Veli Bej&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Un bagno ottomano del XVI secolo restaurato, nel complesso termale storico Császár.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p class=&#34;photo-credit&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Budapest_II.,_%C3%81rp%C3%A1d_fejedelem_%C3%BAtja_%28%C3%9Ajlaki_rakpart%29,_Cs%C3%A1sz%C3%A1r_f%C3%BCrd%C5%91._Fortepan_28832.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Photo: Fortepan 28832&#xA;                (CC BY-SA 3.0)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;figure class=&#34;attraction&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/rudas-baths.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Le Terme Rudas e la collina Gellért a Budapest&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; decoding=&#34;async&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;figcaption class=&#34;attraction-caption&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h3&gt;Terme Rudas&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p&gt;Uno storico bagno turco con una caratteristica piscina sotto la cupola e vista sul Danubio.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;p class=&#34;photo-credit&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Rudas_Baths_central_part_and_Gellert_Hill_in_Tab%C3%A1n,_2016_Budapest.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Photo: Globetrotter19&#xA;                (CC BY-SA 3.0)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/figcaption&gt;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
